PHP Billiards HUD typography
The HUD font atlas (games/php-billiards/assets/generated/ui-font.*) is generated from
Barlow Semi Condensed Medium and Bold, Copyright 2017 The Barlow Project Authors
(https://github.com/jpt/barlow), licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
Extracted glyph outlines and the license are in games/php-billiards/art/typography/; the license
ships beside the atlas as ui-font-OFL.txt.

PHP Billiards ball numerals
The numerals on the billiard balls are digit outlines from Lobster by Pablo Impallari
(Impallari Type, https://github.com/impallari/The-Lobster-Font), licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1. The outlines are in games/php-billiards/art/typography/ball-numerals.json and
the license is in games/php-billiards/art/typography/Lobster-OFL.txt.

PHP Billiards sound effects
games/php-billiards/assets/audio/ contains recorded billiards samples supplied by the
project author and cleared for redistribution with this project:
  clack.mp3        (originally 539854-za-games-billiard-ball-clack.mp3)
  impact.mp3       (originally billiard-balls-impact.mp3)
  pocket-drop.mp3  (originally pool-ball-falling-into-pocket.mp3)
  pocket-drop-hit-1.mp3, pocket-drop-hit-2.mp3, pocket-drop-hit-3.mp3
                   (the three wall knocks of pocket-drop.mp3, split by the project author;
                   1 is the strongest)
  pocket-sink.mp3  (originally one-snooker-ball-sinking-into-on-of-the-pockets.mp3)
  rail-hit.mp3     (originally 13902_33634-lq-ball-hits-rail.mp3): the Freesound preview of
                   "50.wav" by adcbicycle, https://freesound.org/s/13902/, released under
                   Creative Commons 0 (public domain dedication)

